{
 "uid": "kestrel-release",
 "title": "payments-api \u2014 is a release safe?",
 "description": "A release in progress, measured from the traffic each version served rather than from the controller's declared weight.",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "editable": false,
 "refresh": "30s",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-30m",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "tags": [
  "kestrel-pay"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "name": "namespace",
    "label": "environment",
    "type": "custom",
    "query": "dev,staging",
    "current": {
     "text": "dev",
     "value": "dev"
    },
    "options": [
     {
      "text": "dev",
      "value": "dev",
      "selected": true
     },
     {
      "text": "staging",
      "value": "staging",
      "selected": false
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "Is a release happening?",
   "collapsed": false,
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 1,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "panels": []
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How to read this",
   "datasource": null,
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 9,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 1
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### What this is\n\nA release in progress, read **from the traffic**, not from the controller's own\nstatus.\n\nEach version's pods carry a hash. The requests they answer are counted against\nit, so the share each version is actually serving can be measured rather than\ntaken on trust. A declared weight and a served share are different claims, and\nonly the second one is evidence.\n\n### At rest\n\nOne version, serving 100%. The panels below are nearly empty and that is\ncorrect \u2014 there is no release to show.\n\n### During a release\n\nTwo versions. The share should settle near 10%, then 30%, then 60% as the steps\nadvance, with three minutes at each.\n\n### The red lines\n\nThe gate's own thresholds. The floor on requests a second is the one that\nmatters most: a candidate that cannot stay up serves almost nothing and\ntherefore *fails* almost nothing, so error share alone would promote it."
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Versions serving",
   "description": "More than one means a release is in flight.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 8,
    "y": 1
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     },
     "unit": null,
     "decimals": 0,
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [],
     "noValue": "no data"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "textMode": "auto",
    "colorMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "graphMode": "area"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "count(count by (rollouts_pod_template_hash) (payments_api_build_info{namespace=\"$namespace\"})) or vector(0)",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Pods",
   "description": "Across all versions. A canary costs one pod, not two: any weight below 100% rounds a two-replica service to a single candidate.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 16,
    "y": 1
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "blue"
     },
     "unit": null,
     "decimals": 0,
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [],
     "noValue": "no data"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "textMode": "auto",
    "colorMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "graphMode": "area"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "count(payments_api_build_info{namespace=\"$namespace\"}) or vector(0)",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Which versions, and how much each is serving",
   "description": "The hash is the controller's; the version is the one committed in the environment file. Share is measured over the last two minutes.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 16,
    "x": 8,
    "y": 5
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "left"
     },
     "unit": null,
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "noValue": "no versions reporting"
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "share %"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "percent"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A",
     "format": "table",
     "instant": true,
     "expr": "payments_api_build_info{namespace=\"$namespace\"}"
    },
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B",
     "format": "table",
     "instant": true,
     "expr": "100 * sum by (rollouts_pod_template_hash) (rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path=\"/\"}[2m])) / scalar(sum(rate(payments_api_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", path=\"/\"}[2m])))"
    }
   ],
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "joinByField",
     "options": {
      "byField": "rollouts_pod_template_hash",
      "mode": "outer"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true,
       "Time 1": true,
       "Time 2": true,
       "__name__": true,
       "container": true,
       "endpoint": true,
       "instance": true,
       "job": true,
       "namespace": true,
       "pod": true,
       "service": true,
       "Value #A": true
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "rollouts_pod_template_hash": "hash",
       "version": "version",
       "Value #B": "share %"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "The split, as served rather than as declared",
   "collapsed": false,
